ore than 30 miles of blazed trails and free parking at the Notch Visitor Center.","source_url":"https://www.mass.gov/locations/mount-holyoke-range-state-park","source_title":"Mount Holyoke Range State Park | Mass.gov","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open sunrise to sunset. Use marked trails, bring water, and follow DCR restrictions; parking at the Notch Visitor Center is free.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"abbey-memorial-chapel","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Abbey Memorial Chapel","title":"Sit quietly in Abbey Memorial Chapel","subtitle":"Mount Holyoke College campus","notes":"When the chapel is not in use, meet for a quiet reset, journal for a few minutes, or sit together respectfully before continuing your day.","short_summary":"A campus space for a calm, no-cost pause.","evidence_claim":"Mount Holyoke says visitors may sit, pray, meditate, or rest in Abbey Memorial Chapel when it is not in use.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/student-experience/community-and-belonging/religion-and-spirituality/quiet-contemplative-and-spiritual-places-campus","source_title":"Quiet, Contemplative and Spiritual Places on Campus | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Enter only when the chapel is not in use and respect services, ceremonies, and posted campus access guidance.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"wa-shin-an","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Wa-shin-an","title":"Pause at Wa-shin-an","subtitle":"Mount Holyoke College campus","notes":"Visit during the listed open period, move quietly through the space, and make it a short reflection stop with a friend or a solo reset.","short_summary":"A contemplative campus destination open beyond the coll