tery-Brook-Park","source_title":"Buttery Brook Park | South Hadley, MA","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Scheduled Fridays, 5:00–7:30 p.m., May 15–September 11, 2026, except July 3; check for cancellations. Vendors are optional.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"buttery-brook-picnic-tables","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Buttery Brook Park Picnic Tables","title":"Claim a picnic-table conversation spot","subtitle":"Buttery Brook Park, South Hadley","notes":"Use one of the park’s picnic tables for a read-aloud, cards you already own, or a long catch-up; leave the table clear for the next group.","short_summary":"An outdoor table hang without booking a pavilion.","evidence_claim":"South Hadley lists picnic tables and seating areas at Buttery Brook Park, while the park’s general use is listed as free.","source_url":"https://www.southhadley.org/1200/Buttery-Brook-Park","source_title":"Buttery Brook Park | South Hadley, MA","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use unreserved general-use seating; pavilions and the log cabin are separate rental facilities.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"buttery-brook-verdance-sculpture","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Verdance","title":"Find the Verdance sculpture","subtitle":"Buttery Brook Park, between pickleball parking and the playground","notes":"Take a short park walk to the sculpture, compare details from different angles, and use it as a clear meeting point before another park activity.","short_summary":"A named public artwork to seek out in the park.","evidence_claim":"South Hadley’s Buttery Brook Park reopening information identifies the new sculpture “Verdance” between pickleball parking and the playground; general park use is free.","so